{"nodes": [{"id": "specs__archive_003_llm_flag_inference_contracts_cli_contract", "label": "CLI Contract \u2014 Infer\u00eancia LLM das flags do mvn archetype:generate", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "specs/_archive/003-llm-flag-inference/contracts/cli-contract.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "specs__archive_003_llm_flag_inference_contracts_cli_contract_cli_argument_surface", "label": "CLI argument surface \u2014 --use-case-description, --use-case-contract (stdin), --cache-dir, --contract-dir, --inference-bin", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "specs/_archive/003-llm-flag-inference/contracts/cli-contract.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "specs__archive_003_llm_flag_inference_contracts_cli_contract_external_inference_script_contract", "label": "External inference script contract (LLM-facing, temperature=0, argv/files modes)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "specs/_archive/003-llm-flag-inference/contracts/cli-contract.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The mechanism stays free of LLM SDK dependencies: the operator brings their own LLM client wrapped in a thin script (research.md Decision 6). temperature=0 is enforced contractually because FR-012 requires byte-equivalent output on repeat runs."}, {"id": "specs__archive_003_llm_flag_inference_contracts_cli_contract_provenance_report", "label": "Provenance report output (FR-020) \u2014 CONTRACT / CONTRACT_DERIVED / INFERENCE / DEFAULT", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "specs/_archive/003-llm-flag-inference/contracts/cli-contract.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Operator decision (2026-10-16): a super-objective on-screen report of how the demand was satisfied \u2014 which flags came from the contract, which were derived, which inferred, which fell to default, which LLM proposals were discarded (FR-009) and which values were rejected by regex (FR-006). Emitted on stderr so stdout stays contract-pure; the report body is cached with the command so cache hits serve the same report."}, {"id": "specs__archive_003_llm_flag_inference_contracts_cli_contract_cache_jsonl_format", "label": "cache.jsonl line format \u2014 v2 {k, v, r, t} with v1 fallback", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "specs/_archive/003-llm-flag-inference/contracts/cli-contract.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "specs__archive_003_llm_flag_inference_contracts_cli_contract_cache_key_derivation", "label": "Cache key derivation \u2014 SHA-256(catalogFingerprint + description + canonicalContract + contractFilePathOrNone)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "specs/_archive/003-llm-flag-inference/contracts/cli-contract.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The produced command line is a function of the catalog. Without the catalog fingerprint in the key, a catalog change would leave stale cached lines reachable; with it, any catalog change makes every older entry unreachable \u2014 invalidation without migration and without changing the on-disk format. The materialized contract path joined the key (2026-11-11) because the emitted command line carries it: a different --contract-dir must not serve a cached line pointing at the previous location."}, {"id": "specs__archive_003_llm_flag_inference_contracts_cli_contract_error_codes", "label": "Error code summary \u2014 0 success, 2 missing input, 3 inference failure, 4 malformed catalog, 5 internal error", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "specs/_archive/003-llm-flag-inference/contracts/cli-contract.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "specs__archive_003_llm_flag_inference_contracts_cli_contract_materialized_contract", "label": "Materialized contract \u2014 entity_contract_file_path + --contract-dir (FR-023)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "specs/_archive/003-llm-flag-inference/contracts/cli-contract.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "specs__archive_003_llm_flag_inference_contracts_cli_contract_secret_warning", "label": "Secret-like keys warning \u2014 contract is persisted and versioned", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "specs/_archive/003-llm-flag-inference/contracts/cli-contract.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "specs__archive_003_llm_flag_inference_contracts_cli_contract", "target": "specs__archive_003_llm_flag_inference_contracts_cli_contract_cli_argument_surface", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "specs/_archive/003-llm-flag-inference/contracts/cli-contract.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs__archive_003_llm_flag_inference_contracts_cli_contract", "target": "specs__archive_003_llm_flag_inference_contracts_cli_contract_external_inference_script_contract", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "specs/_archive/003-llm-flag-inference/contracts/cli-contract.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs__archive_003_llm_flag_inference_contracts_cli_contract", "target": "specs__archive_003_llm_flag_inference_contracts_cli_contract_provenance_report", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "specs/_archive/003-llm-flag-inference/contracts/cli-contract.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs__arc